␀{"state":"␀␀","message":"␀␀␀ok␀␀fail␀␀␀␀idle␀␀␀␀","elapsed_s":␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=UTF-8>␀<meta name=viewport content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀␀␀<title>NoPorts PoE &#8212; ␀</title>␀␀␀␀<style>␀</style></head><body>␀␀␀<nav class=nav><span class=logo>NoPorts PoE</span>␀␀<a href='/'>Dashboard</a><a href='/settings'>Settings</a>␀␀␀<a href='/config'>Config</a></nav>␀␀<div class=ctr>␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀text/html; charset=utf-8␀␀␀␀<div class=card>␀␀␀␀<h1>Device Setup</h1>␀␀␀<p class=sub>Enter your atSign credentials to enrol this device on the NoPorts network.</p>␀<label>atSign <span style='color:#E84040'>*</span>␀␀<input id=at name=at placeholder='@mydevice' autocomplete=off></label>␀␀<label>Device name <span style='color:#E84040'>*</span>␀<input id=dev name=dev placeholder='esp32_poe' autocomplete=off></label>␀␀␀␀<label>Manager atSign(s) <span style='color:#E84040'>*</span>␀␀␀<input id=mgrs placeholder='@manager1,@manager2'></label>␀␀␀<p class=hint>Comma-separated list of atSigns allowed to open tunnels.</p>␀␀<label>PermitOpen rules <span style='color:#E84040'>*</span>␀␀␀␀<input id=po placeholder='localhost:22,localhost:2222'></label>␀<p class=hint>host:port pairs this device will relay. Use *:0 to allow all.</p>␀<div id=msg></div>␀␀<div class=btns><button class='btn pr' onclick=save()>Save &amp; Enrol</button></div>␀␀␀<script>function save(){var at=document.getElementById('at').value.trim(),dev=document.getElementById('dev').value.trim(),mgrs=document.getElementById('mgrs').value.trim(),po=document.getElementById('po').value.trim();if(!at||!dev||!mgrs||!po){document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">All fields are required.</div>';return;}fetch('/api/setup',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({at:at,device:dev,managers:mgrs,permitopen:po})}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{if(d.ok)location.href='/enroll';else document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+d.error+'</div>';}).catch(e=>{document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+e+'</div>';});}</script>␀<h1>Enrol Device</h1>␀␀␀<p class=sub>Open your atSign app, tap the device &rarr; OTP button, and enter the code below.</p>␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>atSign</span><span class=val>␀␀␀␀</span></div>␀␀␀<label>One-Time Passcode (OTP) <span style='color:#E84040'>*</span>␀<input id=otp placeholder='abc123' autocomplete=off maxlength=30></label>␀␀␀<div id=msg></div><div id=prog class=hide>␀␀<div class='msg inf' id=ptext>Connecting&#8230;</div>␀␀␀<p style='color:#8B9BB4;font-size:.8em;margin-top:8px'>Approval may take up to 5 minutes &mdash; waiting for your atSign app.</p>␀␀␀<div class=btns id=btn_row>␀<button class='btn pr' id=enroll_btn onclick=doEnroll()>Enrol</button>␀␀</div></div>␀␀␀␀<script>var polling=false;function doEnroll(){var otp=document.getElementById('otp').value.trim();if(!otp){document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">Enter OTP.</div>';return;}document.getElementById('enroll_btn').disabled=true;document.getElementById('prog').classList.remove('hide');document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='';fetch('/api/enroll',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({otp:otp})}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{if(d.ok){polling=true;poll();}else{document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+d.error+'</div>';}}).catch(e=>{document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+e+'</div>';});}function poll(){if(!polling)return;fetch('/api/enroll-status').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{document.getElementById('ptext').textContent=d.message||'...';if(d.state==='ok'){polling=false;location.href='/';}else if(d.state==='fail'){polling=false;document.getElementById('prog').classList.add('hide');document.getElementById('enroll_btn').disabled=false;document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+d.message+'</div>';}else setTimeout(poll,2000);}).catch(()=>setTimeout(poll,3000));}</script>␀␀␀␀Enrol␀␀␀<h1>Welcome to NoPorts PoE</h1>␀<p class=sub>Connect your device to the atSign network.</p>␀<div class=btns><a class='btn pr' href='/setup'>Set Up Device</a></div>␀<h2>Device</h2>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>atSign</span><span class=val id=at>␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Device</span><span class=val>␀␀␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>IP</span><span class=val id=ip></span></div>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Uptime</span><span class=val id=up></span></div>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Version</span><span class=val>1.0.0</span></div>␀<div class=card><h2>Daemon</h2>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>State</span><span class=val><span class='badge dim' id=state>&#8230;</span></span></div>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Tunnels (total)</span><span class=val id=tun>&#8230;</span></div>␀␀␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Pings (total)</span><span class=val id=ping>&#8230;</span></div>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Active relays</span><span class=val id=rel>&#8230;</span></div>␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Throughput &#8595;</span><span class=val id=tin>&#8230;</span></div>␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Throughput &#8593;</span><span class=val id=tout>&#8230;</span></div>␀␀␀␀<div class=row><span class=lbl>Relay CPU</span><span class=val id=cpu>&#8230;</span></div>␀␀<div class=btns>␀␀␀␀<a class='btn sc' href='/settings'>Rules</a>␀␀␀␀<a class='btn sc' href='/config'>Config</a>␀<button class='btn sc' id=idbtn onclick=identify()>Identify</button>␀␀␀␀<button class='btn dr' onclick="if(confirm('Reset device?'))fetch('/api/reset',{method:'POST'}).then(()=>location.reload())">Reset</button>␀<script>function fmt(n){if(n<1024)return n+'B';if(n<1048576)return(n/1024).toFixed(1)+'KB';return(n/1048576).toFixed(2)+'MB'}function upd(){fetch('/api/status').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{var s=document.getElementById('state');s.textContent=d.state||'?';s.className='badge '+(d.state==='running'?'ok':d.state==='error'?'err':'dim');document.getElementById('up').textContent=d.uptime||'';document.getElementById('ip').textContent=d.ip||'';document.getElementById('tun').textContent=d.tunnels||0;document.getElementById('ping').textContent=d.pings||0;document.getElementById('rel').textContent=(d.active_relays||0)+'/'+(d.pcb_max||5);document.getElementById('tin').textContent=fmt(d.bytes_in||0)+'/s';document.getElementById('tout').textContent=fmt(d.bytes_out||0)+'/s';document.getElementById('cpu').textContent=(d.relay_cpu||0)+'%';}).catch(()=>{})}upd();setInterval(upd,5000);var _idTimer=null;function identify(){var btn=document.getElementById('idbtn');fetch('/api/identify',{method:'POST'}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{if(!d.ok)return;var secs=d.seconds;btn.disabled=true;if(_idTimer)clearInterval(_idTimer);_idTimer=setInterval(function(){secs--;btn.textContent='Identify ('+secs+'s)';if(secs<=0){clearInterval(_idTimer);btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Identify';}},1000);})}</script>␀␀␀␀Dashboard␀␀␀stopped␀auth␀␀␀␀","atsign":"␀␀␀␀","device":"␀␀␀␀","version":"1.0.0"␀,"uptime":"␀","uptime_s":␀␀␀,"tunnels":␀,"pings":␀␀␀,"bytes_in":␀␀␀␀,"bytes_out":␀␀␀,"relay_cpu":␀␀␀,"active_relays":␀␀␀,"pcb_count":␀␀␀,"pcb_max":␀,"configured":␀␀,"enrolled":␀␀␀␀,"ip":"␀<h1>Advanced Config</h1>␀␀␀␀<p class=sub>Tune performance parameters. Changes take effect immediately.</p>␀␀<label>Worker keep-alive (minutes, 0 = off)␀<input type=number id=ka min=0 max=15 value=␀␀␀␀<p class=hint>Heartbeat to keep atServer TLS session alive. 4 min recommended.</p>␀␀<label>Max concurrent relay sub-connections (1&#8211;8)␀<input type=number id=mrs min=1 max=8 value=␀␀␀␀<p class=hint>Higher values allow more parallel SSH sessions per tunnel.</p>␀␀␀␀<label style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:14px'><input type=checkbox id=wl style='width:auto'␀␀␀␀> Restrict web UI to localhost only (NoPorts access only)</label>␀␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀<p class=hint style='color:#F06000'>&#9888; When enabled, this page is only reachable via a NoPorts tunnel &mdash; direct LAN access will return 403.</p>␀␀␀<label>LED indicator␀␀␀␀<select id=led>␀<option value=␀␀ selected␀␀␀</select></label>␀␀␀<p class=hint>Off: always dark. Heartbeat: single blink = OK, patterns for problems. Status: colour shows state (blue=no net, amber=unconfigured, green=running, red=error). Full: status + white flash on each tunnel.</p>␀<div class=btns><button class='btn pr' onclick=save()>Save</button><a class='btn sc' href='/'>Cancel</a></div>␀␀<script>function save(){var ka=document.getElementById('ka').value,mrs=document.getElementById('mrs').value,wl=document.getElementById('wl').checked,led=document.getElementById('led')?document.getElementById('led').value:null;var body={keepalive:ka,max_relays:mrs,web_local:wl};if(led!==null)body.led_mode=led;fetch('/api/config',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(body)}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{if(d.ok){document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg ok">Saved.</div>';setTimeout(()=>location.href='/',2000);}else document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+d.error+'</div>';});}</script>␀␀␀<option value=0>Managers list</option><option value=1 selected>Policy atSign</option>␀␀␀<option value=0 selected>Managers list</option><option value=1>Policy atSign</option>␀␀␀''␀␀hide␀␀␀␀<h1>Rules &amp; Managers</h1>␀␀␀<p class=sub>Control who can open tunnels through this device.</p>␀␀<label>Authorization mode␀␀␀<select id=mode onchange=modeChange()>␀␀<div id=mgr_block>␀␀<label>Manager atSign(s)<textarea id=mgrs rows=3>␀␀␀</textarea></label>␀<p class=hint>One per line or comma-separated. These atSigns can open tunnels.</p>␀␀<label>PermitOpen rules<textarea id=po rows=3>␀␀<p class=hint>host:port per line or comma-separated. Use *:0 to allow all.</p>␀␀<div id=pol_block class=␀␀␀␀<label>Policy atSign<input id=pol_at placeholder='@mypolicysvc' value='␀'></label>␀␀<p class=hint>This atSign service handles authorization via RPC.</p>␀␀␀␀<script>function modeChange(){var m=document.getElementById('mode').value;document.getElementById('mgr_block').className=m==='1'?'hide':'';document.getElementById('pol_block').className=m==='0'?'hide':'';}function save(){var mode=document.getElementById('mode').value,mgrs=document.getElementById('mgrs').value.replace(/\n/g,','),po=document.getElementById('po').value.replace(/\n/g,','),pol=document.getElementById('pol_at').value.trim();if(mode==='0'){var m=mgrs.trim();if(!m||m.indexOf('@')<0){document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">At least one manager atSign (starting with @) is required</div>';return;}}fetch('/api/settings',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({mode:mode,managers:mgrs,permitopen:po,policy_at:pol})}).then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{if(d.ok){document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg ok">Saved. Restarting daemon&#8230;</div>';setTimeout(()=>location.href='/',3000);}else{document.getElementById('msg').innerHTML='<div class="msg err">'+d.error+'</div>';}});}</script>␀␀Settings␀␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"No body"}␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"At least one manager atSign (starting with @) is required"}␀␀␀␀[web] Settings saved â€” daemon restart deferred to loop()␀␀{"ok":true}␀{"ok":false,"error":"No OTP"}␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"Already running"}␀␀Connecting to atServer...␀␀␀Out of memory␀␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"OOM"}␀␀enroll␀␀{"ok":false,"error":"Missing fields"}␀␀␀[web] Setup saved: %s / %s
