ity:.82}.btns{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.msg{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:5px;font-size:.85em;margin-top:12px}.msg.ok{background:#18A06020;color:#18A060;border:1px solid #18A06040}.msg.err{background:#E8404020;color:#E84040;border:1px solid #E8404040}.msg.inf{background:#F0600020;color:#F06000;border:1px solid #F0600040}.hide{display:none}.hint{color:#8B9BB4;font-size:.75em;margin-top:3px}h1{color:#F06000;font-size:1.1em;margin-bottom:4px}.sub{color:#8B9BB4;font-size:.82em;margin-bottom:16px}␀␀␀␀ @$¬@h`@0@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀f@Rf@_@&_@´^@_@®^@Ü^@º^@T]@_@’q@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Fg@Hg@Tn@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ºn@ ␀␀@¸n@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Nq@œ.␀@’q@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Rr@`r@Br@àr@ ␀␀@@r@|r@‚r@ºr@Nq@œ.␀@’q@__digitalWrite␀␀__pinMode␀␀␀initArduino␀disableCore0WDT␀enableCore0WDT␀␀perimanGetBusDeinit␀perimanClearBusDeinit␀␀␀perimanSetBusDeinit␀perimanGetPinBusChannel␀perimanGetPinBusNum␀perimanGetPinBusExtraType␀␀␀perimanGetPinBusType␀␀␀␀perimanGetPinBus␀␀␀␀perimanSetPinBus␀␀␀␀psramAddToHeap␀␀psramInit␀␀␀spiAttachSS␀uart_get_max_rx_timeout␀uartDetectBaudrate␀␀uartStartDetectBaudrate␀uartSetBaudRate␀uartFlushTxOnly␀uartEnd␀uartSetRxFIFOFull␀␀␀uartSetRxTimeout␀␀␀␀uartBegin␀␀␀lp_uart_config_io␀␀␀_uartTrySetIomuxPin␀_uartDetachBus_RX␀␀␀_uartDetachBus_TX␀␀␀_uartDetachBus_CTS␀␀_uartDetachBus_RTS␀␀_uartAttachPins␀_uartDetachPins␀_uartValidatePins␀␀␀uartSetPins␀setCpuFrequencyMhz␀␀removeApbChangeCallback␀io_ldo_release_handle␀␀␀io_ldo_try_acquire␀␀ldoReleaseChannel␀␀␀ldoAcquireChannel␀␀␀gpio_func_sel␀␀␀gpio_sleep_sel_dis␀␀gpio_sleep_sel_en␀␀␀gpio_sleep_pullup_dis␀␀␀gpio_sleep_pulldown_dis␀gpio_sleep_pullup_en␀␀␀␀gpio_sleep_pulldown_en␀␀gpio_sleep_set_pull_mode␀␀␀␀gpio_sleep_set_direction␀␀␀␀gpio_iomux_output␀␀␀gpio_iomux_input␀␀␀␀gpio_hold_dis␀␀␀gpio_hold_en␀␀␀␀gpio_set_drive_capability␀␀␀gpio_isr_register␀␀␀gpio_isr_handler_remove␀gpio_isr_handler_add␀␀␀␀gpio_install_isr_service␀␀␀␀gpio_reset_pin␀␀gpio_input_disable␀␀gpio_set_direction␀␀gpio_set_pull_mode␀␀gp